==In animation==
[[File:Gentleman EP015.png|thumb|left|250px|A Gentleman in the [[original series]]]]
[[File:Gentleman JN.png|thumb|250px|A Gentleman in ''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series]]'']]
A Gentleman appeared in ''[[EP015|Battle Aboard the St. Anne]]''. His main Pokémon is a {{AP|Raticate}}, which is able to use {{m|Jump Kick}}. After having a {{pkmn|battle}} with {{Ash}}, he became impressed by [[Ash's Butterfree]] and suggested he'd [[trade]] the {{pkmn|category|Butterfly Pokémon}} for his Raticate. Ash initially accepted the offer, but during a confrontation against [[Team Rocket]], which both he and the Gentleman participated in, Ash grew worried about his Butterfree. Once Team Rocket's invasion had been stopped, Ash and the Gentleman reversed the trade just as the [[S.S. Anne|St. Anne]] was sinking due to a storm.

A Gentleman appeared in {{MTR}}'s fantasy in ''[[EP174|Imitation Confrontation]]''.

A Gentleman appeared in ''[[EP205|The Kecleon Caper]]'', where his first aid kit was stolen by two {{p|Kecleon}}.

A Gentleman appeared in ''[[AG157|Time Warp Heals All Wounds]]''.

A Gentleman appeared in ''[[JN033|Trade, Borrow, and Steal!]]'', where he traded away his Farfetch'd for a Spearow.
{{-}}

