In ''[[PS309|Moving Past Milotic]]'', {{adv|Emerald}} has his Pokémon healed by a Gentleman in one of the [[Battle Pike]] rooms.

In ''[[PS319|Verily Vanquishing Vileplume I]]'', a Gentleman named '''Walter''' (Robert in the [[Chuang Yi]] translation) is seen battling {{tc|Ninja Boy}} Lao in the [[Battle Dome]]. While it is unknown who won, what is known is that Walter at some point lost a match, eliminating him from the tournament.

===={{MangaArc|HeartGold & SoulSilver}}====
In ''[[PS442|Out-Odding Oddish]]'', {{adv|Gold}} accidentally bumped into a Gentleman with his {{p|Pichu}} while racing to get to the [[Pokéathlon Dome]].

===={{MangaArc|Diamond & Pearl}}====
Another Gentleman appears in ''[[PS361|Bombastic Bibarel and Heroic Hippopotas]]'' where he, along with a {{tc|Madame|Socialite}}, battles {{adv|Diamond}} and {{adv|Pearl}}.

===={{MangaArc|X & Y}}====
A Gentleman was seen in {{adv|Blue}}'s flashback in ''[[PS582|Pinsir Glares]]''.

